<title>POLAND: BYTOM OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BYTOM OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.18 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.40 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.13 vs   0.98</p>
<p> Sales		    8.99 vs   7.75</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.44 vs   2.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.02 vs   3.94</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.74 vs   7.31</p>
<p> Sales		   72.25 vs  64.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
